# Environment templates live next to each app:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example  → copy to apps/api/.env   (Verity service: SERVER-SIDE secrets —
#                             DATABASE_URL, SESSION_SECRET, SMTP_URL, NIMBLE_API_KEY, RAWTREE_API_KEY, …)
#   apps/web/.env.example  → copy to apps/web/.env.local or .env.production.local
#                             (frontend: PUBLIC VITE_* values only, never secrets)
#
# Real values are never committed: every .env* file except these templates is git-ignored.
